    "DefaultText": "The Inn Keeper serves hot meals and rents out beds from behind this counter. Drag Salt, metal Nuggets, or Duros Coins onto the counter to fund your Inn Account (holds up to 500); a meal or a night's stay draws 50 from that balance (more while you are Wanted or Banished). Drag Firewood onto the counter to sell it for Salt. There is usually odd work available too, paid in copper nuggets."
  },
