        "DefaultText": "Wager on the Dice"
      },
      "ActionDescription": {
        "LocalizationKey": "CMC_InnCounter_Wager_ActionDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Drag Bone Dice or Loaded Dice onto the counter and stake 25 from your Inn Account on a roll against a resident. Honest dice win a little under half the time and a win pays twice the stake; loaded dice win more often, but a resident may catch the weight, which costs the stake and adds to your Village Crime. You keep the dice. Needs someone at the Inn with you."
